────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ADDITIONAL EXPLICIT PERMISSIONS — APK MODDING & REVERSE ENGINEERING
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This project is intentionally open for modding, decompiling, and
reverse engineering, in addition to the rights already granted above.
For the avoidance of doubt, and to make this explicit for anyone
reading the license before modifying a compiled APK build of this
software, the following is expressly permitted without seeking further
permission from the copyright holder:

1. DECOMPILING & DISASSEMBLING
   You may decompile, disassemble, or otherwise reverse engineer any
   compiled APK/AAB build of this Software using any tool, including
   but not limited to MT Manager, APKTool, jadx, JEB, Ghidra,
   dex2jar, Smali/Baksmali, or any similar tool — for any purpose,
   including study, modification, translation, rebranding, or
   personal use.

2. MODIFYING & REPACKAGING
   You may modify the decompiled or disassembled resources, Smali/DEX
   bytecode, layouts, strings, drawables, or any other component of
   the compiled app, and repackage/re-sign it under a different
   application ID, package name, or app label.

3. REDISTRIBUTING MODIFIED BUILDS
   You may redistribute a modified build (a "mod" or "fork") in
   binary (APK/AAB) or source form, provided that:
     a. You clearly indicate that your version is modified and is
        not the original, unmodified release from this repository;
     b. You retain this license file (or a copy of it) with your
        redistributed version, unmodified in substance; and
     c. You do not use the name "MIMO" or the original app icon in a
        way that falsely implies your modified version is the
        official, unmodified release, unless clearly labeled as a
        "mod," "fork," or "unofficial build."

4. NO WARRANTY ON MODIFIED BUILDS
   Any modified build is entirely the responsibility of whoever
   produced it. The original author(s) of this Software provide no
   support, warranty, or guarantee of safety, correctness, or fitness
   for any modified/repackaged version, whether or not it was built
   from this source code.

5. TRADEMARK / BRANDING NOTE (NON-COPYRIGHT)
   This permission covers copyright only. It does not grant rights to
   use the "MIMO" name or logo to imply official endorsement of a
   modified build. You are free to fork, rebrand, and redistribute
   under a different name and icon at any time.

In short: fork it, decompile it, mod it, rebrand it, learn from it —
just don't pretend an unofficial modified build is the original
release, and keep this license file attached.
